---
// Engineering Leadership Endorsements Component
---

<section id="endorsements" class="space-y-8 scroll-mt-24 pt-8">
  <!-- Section Heading -->
  <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-end justify-between border-b border-[#1E293B] pb-4 gap-4">
    <div>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-[#38BDF8] font-mono text-xs tracking-wider uppercase mb-1">
        <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-[#38BDF8]" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m5.618-4.016A11.955 11.955 0 0112 2.944a11.955 11.955 0 01-8.618 3.04A12.02 12.02 0 003 9c0 5.591 3.824 10.29 9 11.622 5.176-1.332 9-6.03 9-11.622 0-1.042-.133-2.052-.382-3.016z" />
        </svg>
        <span>Verified Credentials & Trust</span>
      </div>
      <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-[#F8FAFC]">Engineering Leadership Endorsements</h2>
    </div>
    <p class="text-sm text-[#94A3B8] max-w-md">
      Verified references from senior engineering department heads and industry leaders.
    </p>
  </div>

  <!-- 2 Frosted Glass Endorsement Cards -->
  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
    <!-- Endorsement 1: Engr. Niger Sultana -->
    <div class="p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-2xl border border-[#1E293B] bg-[#0F172A]/70 backdrop-blur-xl relative flex flex-col justify-between hover:border-[#38BDF8]/50 hover:-translate-y-1 transition-all duration-300 group">
      <div class="space-y-4">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
          <span class="text-[#38BDF8] text-3xl font-serif opacity-80 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform">“</span>
          <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full bg-[#090D16] border border-[#1E293B] font-mono text-[11px] text-[#38BDF8]">
            Verified Academic & Engineering Head
          </span>
        </div>
        <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-[#CBD5E1] italic leading-relaxed">
          "Mahmudul possesses exceptional proficiency in low-level systems architectures, hardware protocol interfacing, and high-performance computing. His mastery over modern concurrency and rigorous engineering fundamentals sets him apart as an elite systems builder."
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="pt-6 mt-6 border-t border-[#1E293B] flex items-center justify-between">
        <div>
          <div class="text-base font-bold text-[#F8FAFC]">Engr. Niger Sultana</div>
          <div class="text-xs text-[#94A3B8]">Head of Department (HOD), CST</div>
          <div class="font-mono text-xs text-[#38BDF8] mt-0.5">Dhaka Polytechnic Institute (DPI)</div>
        </div>
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-[#090D16] border border-[#1E293B] flex items-center justify-center text-[#10B981]">
          <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
            <path d="M12 14l9-5-9-5-9 5 9 5z" />
            <path d="M12 14l6.16-3.422a12.083 12.083 0 01.665 6.479A11.952 11.952 0 0012 20.055a11.952 11.952 0 00-6.824-2.998 12.078 12.078 0 01.665-6.479L12 14z" />
          </svg>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Endorsement 2: Nazrul Hasan Raju -->
    <div class="p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-2xl border border-[#1E293B] bg-[#0F172A]/70 backdrop-blur-xl relative flex flex-col justify-between hover:border-[#10B981]/50 hover:-translate-y-1 transition-all duration-300 group">
      <div class="space-y-4">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
          <span class="text-[#10B981] text-3xl font-serif opacity-80 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform">“</span>
          <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full bg-[#090D16] border border-[#1E293B] font-mono text-[11px] text-[#10B981]">
            Verified Industry Executive Reference
          </span>
        </div>
        <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-[#CBD5E1] italic leading-relaxed">
          "A rare breed of engineer who effortlessly navigates between hardware-level device communication daemons and enterprise web platforms. Mahmudul's execution on fault-tolerant deployments and real-time networking has been exemplary."
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="pt-6 mt-6 border-t border-[#1E293B] flex items-center justify-between">
        <div>
          <div class="text-base font-bold text-[#F8FAFC]">Nazrul Hasan Raju</div>
          <div class="text-xs text-[#94A3B8]">Managing Director</div>
          <div class="font-mono text-xs text-[#10B981] mt-0.5">Nexus Netro Ltd</div>
        </div>
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-[#090D16] border border-[#1E293B] flex items-center justify-center text-[#38BDF8]">
          <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M21 13.255A23.931 23.931 0 0112 15c-3.183 0-6.22-.62-9-1.745M16 6V4a2 2 0 00-2-2h-4a2 2 0 00-2 2v2m4 6h.01M5 20h14a2 2 0 002-2V8a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2z" />
          </svg>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
